abstract: >-
  MTW TinyLoopScheduler is a header-only cooperative scheduler for
  Arduino-compatible targets with automatic AVR and Generic backends.
  It provides static PERIODIC, DELAYED, POSTED, POLL, and optional PARTED
  execution, with independently switchable AVR IDLE and ISR deferral.
keywords:
  - Arduino
  - AVR
  - embedded systems
  - cooperative scheduling
  - static memory
  - task scheduler
